n| `postCreateCommand` | `bash scripts/seed-dev-env.sh --devcontainer` | Seeds the contributor home the way a workspace start seeds a workspace. |"],[455,"| Key          | Value   | Why |\n| ------------ | ------- | --- |\n| `remoteUser` | `coder` |     |"],[458,"| Key       | Value                                          | Why                                           |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `runArgs` | `--add-host=host.docker.internal:host-gateway` | `:4000` and SearXNG on `:8181` on the laptop. |"],[457,"| Key      | Value                  | Why                                                                                                       |\n| -------- | ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `mounts` | `/var/run/docker.sock` | The container talks to the workstation's own daemon, which is how a `docker run` inside it is a real one. |"],[746,"| Mount                        | Inside      | Why                              |\n| ---------------------------- | ----------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `hermes-data` (named volume) | `/opt/data` | config, sessions, memory, SQLite |"],[747,"| Mount                   | Inside                           | Why                     |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `${STACK_HOST_PATH:-.}` | `${STACK_HOST_PATH:-/opt/stack}` | identical-path checkout |"],[749,"| Mount                  | Inside                 | Why                           |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `/var/run/docker.sock` | `/var/run/docker.sock` | compose and container control |"],[748,"| Mount             | Inside                   | Why                |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------ |\n| `./hermes/skills` | `/opt/stack-skills` (ro) | git-tracked skills |"],[1039,"| Name                              | `proxy/router.conf` upstream |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `litellm-gmktecbeast.overeazy.io` | `litellm:4000`               |"],[1040,"| Name                             | `proxy/router.conf` upstream |\n| -------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `hermes-gmktecbeast.overeazy.io` | `hermes:9119`                |"],[1037,"| Name                            | `proxy/router.conf` upstream  |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `coder-gmktecbeast.overeazy.io` | `coder:3000` - plain listener |"],[1038,"| Name                           | `proxy/router.conf` upstream                 |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `kasm-gmktecbeast.overeazy.io` | `https://kasm:4443` (`proxy_ssl_verify off`) |"],[1036,"| Name                      | `proxy/router.conf` upstream |\n| ------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `gmktecbeast.overeazy.io` | `homepage:3000`              |"],[125,"| Read from `.env`     | Passed as            | Condition                                                     |\n| -------------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `LITELLM_MASTER_KEY` | `--var litellm_key=` | only when the key is real, never the `change-me*` placeholder |"],[133,"| Read from `.env`    | Passed as                                              | Condition                                                 |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `STACK_SEARCH_PORT` | `--var searxng_url=http://host.docker.internal:<port>` | always; a blank or non-numeric value falls back to `8181` |"],[127,"| Read from `.env`    | Passed as                  | Condition                                                                                        |\n| ------------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `GROK_PROFILE_MODE` | `--var grok_profile_mode=` | when non-empty; the retired `GROK_PROFILE_SHARE` maps (`true` to `shared`, `false` to `private`) |"],[131,"| Read from `.env`   | Passed as                    | Condition                                      |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `CONTEXT7_API_KEY` | `--var context7_api_key=...` | only when non-empty; the value is never logged |"],[126,"| Read from `.env`  | Passed as                | Condition                           |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| `CODER_AGENT_URL` | `--var coder_agent_url=` | only when the key is present at all |"],[130,"| Read from `.env` | Passed as                  | Condition                                                                                                                                        |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `CONTEXT7_MCP`   | `--var context7_mcp=false` | only when the value is `false` (the cached context7 MCP server is on by default; any other value pushes nothing and the template default stands) |"],[129,"| Read from `.env` | Passed as                | Condition                                                                                                                               |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `GITHUB_MCP`     | 